## Summary

I implemented the **`Tooltip` Apple shared surface (P4 · 0231)** at full parity with `web/src/components/ui/Tooltip.tsx`, following the established sibling-surface architecture (HelpTooltip 0216). **8 files**, all in the allowed `Tooltip.*` scope:

- **`Tooltip.Adapter.swift`** — pure core: surface slug, i18n seam, `TooltipSide` (web `side` + `left→leading`/`right→trailing`, RTL-aware reveal-offset math), `TooltipLayout` (web Tailwind metrics), `TooltipProjector` (empty-content guard + `aria-describedby` join).
- **`Tooltip.Model.swift`** — P1/S10 strings facade, P1/S11 telemetry seam, `@Observable` `TooltipController` (`useId`-peer id, reveal state, once-only `view.opened`).
- **`Tooltip.Views.swift` / `Tooltip.swift`** — inverted-surface card (token-only), 4-side positioning, hover/tap/programmatic reveal, Reduce-Motion, `aria-describedby` hint, string-content convenience.
- **`Tooltip.Previews.swift`**, **`Tooltip.strings`**, **`Tooltip.Tests.swift` + `Tooltip.AdapterTests.swift`** (42 tests).

**Surface verification — all GREEN:** standalone typecheck (macOS 15) ✓ · `swift test` **42/42** ✓ · swiftlint `--strict` 0 violations ✓ · swiftformat 0 issues ✓ · placeholder gate 0 ✓.

